L["The game ends at the end of a round in which a player's Morale reaches 0, or at the end of round 8. More Morale wins. If Morale is tied, the player with more units on the board wins; if that's tied too, it's a draw."] = "The game ends at the end of a round in which a player's Morale reaches 0, or at the end of round 8. More Morale wins. If Morale is tied, the player with more units on the board wins; if that's tied too, it's a draw."
